[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/title_screen.gd" id="1"]

; Background: a vertical sky gradient (blue -> mint -> cream), ported from
; archive/images/mockups/01-title.svg's `skyTitle` gradient (2026-08-24 title screen
; redesign). Distinct on purpose from UiPalette's green/cream in-game chrome — the title
; screen is the game's "front door" moment, not part of the HUD's own palette family.
